    "body": "Problem:\n\"clear\" and readline's <C-l> erase the screen (ED 2), but the extmarks\non the erased rows remain, so \"[[\" jumps to prompts that are gone.\n\nSolution:\nWhen ED 2 or RIS erases the whole primary screen, clear the extmarks on\nits rows. Queue this with TermRequest events so that prompts marked\nafter the erase keep their marks.\n\nFix #41961\n\nResubmission of #42035.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
